{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈子だよー٩(◦`꒳´◦)۶♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/26/8089716/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/26/8089716/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/26/8089716/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、時間がなくてブログをはやめに書き上げるのでものすごく短いですが\nごめんなさい(╥ω╥`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も朝からみんなで撮影だったのですが、生田さんに久しぶりに会ったら\nじーーーっと大きい目でみられて\n「私が今までみてきた北野日奈子史上、1番可愛い」と、言われ\n横にいたあっしゅんを\n生田さんの方へ突きとばしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく照れました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく嬉しかったです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は、乃木坂の2期生オーディションの\n2次審査で目標とするメンバーを聞かれた時、同い年の生田絵梨花さんと答えたのです(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっしゅんとも久しぶりに少し長めに話すことができて、やっぱり性格が合うな～と思いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑いのツボが同じ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑いのがツボが同じって\n仲良くなるのに結構大事な要素ですよね！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お姫とも、お話ししなくちゃ(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お姫をみると癒されます。\n未央奈は、頑張り屋です。\n花奈さんと目があうとわざと\n威嚇顔でみます。\n蘭世と2人で身長を伸ばしたくて、一緒にジャンプしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンクエトワールです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/26/8089716/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/26/8089716/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンクエトワールで\n青春した場所"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/26/8089716/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はお仕事帰りに\nお父さんが迎えにきてくれたんですが、その車の中でステーキの話を少ししました(｡・・｡)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ステーキたべにいきたい(｡・・｡)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、私の周りでダイエットが流行りだしたので、いい加減、私もダイエットしようと思いますが、来週からにします٩(◦`꒳´◦)۶笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/26/8089716/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/26/8089716/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"威嚇プク顔"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/26/8089716/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあ、今日はこの辺で！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またかきます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさいー！！！"}],"source":"archive"}